  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶、お疲れ\r\n次の現場まで少しかかるから、休んでくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、ありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "把握してると思うけど、次はドラマの収録だ\r\n２時間サスペンスの、主人公のかつての相棒役",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ、台本だけでも面白かったよ\r\nアクションシーンや銃撃戦も楽しみだ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………動物系バラエティ収録から、\r\n２時間サスペンスの収録……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ん？",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、仕事とはいえすごい差だと思ってさ……\r\n……切り替え、大丈夫か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "心配ご無用だよ\r\n……気遣ってくれて、ありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──ああ、アナタにお礼を言うべきことはまだあるか",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……私に来る仕事を、全て受けてくれてありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私に無理がないようスケジュールを組むのに、\r\nかなり難儀しているのではないかな？",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、俺は今までと同じようにしているだけだよ\r\n仕事を全部受けてくれるのは、ありがたいことだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "…………フフ、それならウイン・ウイン、かな",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "………………",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
