    "bg": "00161",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2700
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "text": "──『モデルの頃の咲耶様に、戻ってほしいです』",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00129",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2700
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だから私は──……\r\nもう、戻ることはできない",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………それが、咲耶にとって後悔しない、\r\n一番いい選択だと思えるなら",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフ、私の選択はいつも最良だよ\r\n私はいつも、最良の選択をしてここにいる",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "誰もが、瞬間ごとの最良を選び続けて……\r\nそうして私たちは出会った",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そう思って、生きている\r\n……生きていきたいと、思っている",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "…………アイドルになってから、\r\nもらう言葉の種類が増えた",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……かっこいい、綺麗、可愛い、素敵、面白い",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……クス、『面白い』だなんて、\r\nアイドルになる前の私では到底もらえなかった言葉だ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに……\r\nでも、アンティーカといる時の咲耶を見たら……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050240,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "おや、アナタにも笑いを提供できているということか\r\nそれは素晴らしいことだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "みんなトークが上手いんだよな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050250,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私を好きになってくれた人たちは、\r\nとても嬉しい言葉を私にくれた",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050260,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私はワガママだからね、\r\nその中でどれかだけを選ぶなんてことは、できないんだ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050260"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050270,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "だから──\r\nだから、私は、そのすべてに応える私でいたい",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………ああ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050280,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "かっこいい、でも。綺麗、でも。\r\n可愛い、でも。素敵、でも。面白い、でも",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050280"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050290,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ひとが私に求めるものすべてに、私は応えよう\r\n──そう、思うんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600305/1006003050290"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006003050291,
    "speaker": "咲耶＆プロデューサー",
